fined and forged, <b>Bombastic</b> takes on a honeycomb-like appearance.\n</p><p>Referring to Roblox Texture Series - Bombastic\n</p><p>The ore was introduced with Oakland's 2nd anniversary.\n</p><p>Also, the raw ore appears to be similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Copper\" title=\"Copper\">copper</a>.\n</p><p>Bombastic has a special property: The forged version doesn't say \"Forged Bombastic\", it says \"Omeaga Bombastic\".\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163043\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019433/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.968      1 Template:Ore\n100.00%   40.968      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3762-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163043 and revision id 21494. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Classic Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Classic Store","exists":true},{"title":"Copper","exists":true},{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true}],"images":["Bombastic.png","RefinedBombastic.webp","ForgeBombastic.webp"]}
